| CXL Type-2/backing/security | Captured original operation parent до Submit/publication/cleanup: [Type-2](../../artifacts/v6/iteration-20261008-cxl-type2-original-operation-parent/report.md). Original fabric/memory для Region damage и release: [backing consequence](../../artifacts/v6/iteration-20261008-cxl-original-backing-consequence/report.md). Readiness до/после provider queries: [security source](../../artifacts/v6/iteration-20261008-cxl-security-original-effect-source/report.md) |
